{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今電車に揺られながらブログを\n書いているんですけど、\nドアが開くたびに冷たい風が\n入ってきて足がとても寒いです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか、このブログ書いてるこの今日\nすんごく風が冷たい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駅に着く頃にはブログ完成するかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/01/24/6424120/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりんぬ、伊織といる時だけは\nおかしいホルモンが体から出てきて\nヘンテコになりますみり愛さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織といると楽しい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日は幕張にて握手会がありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/01/24/6424120/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで突然のみりあんさー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/01/24/6424120/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このポーズ、誰が考えたと思います？\nこれ問題となっておりますので、\n正解者にはするめ一年分差し上げます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていうのもそろそろ飽きてくる頃かな\nと思うので、また後日ブログで\n正解発表したいと思います～(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、これ正解された方尊敬するレベルで\nすごいと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/01/24/6424120/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤のワンピース、真っ赤なのがまたいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中、たくさんの方が来てくださいました。\n本当に本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手で少しでも暖まってくれていたら嬉しいです(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、新しい本を2冊買いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\" 君の膵臓をたべたい/佐野よる \"\n\" i /西加奈子 \""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君の膵臓をたべたいの会話のテンポや\n文章はとても好きです、\n清純で切なくて、頭にスッと入ってくる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵や〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"iはまだ読んでいないので早く読みたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本屋さんにいると、つい長居してしまう\nたぶん半日はいれる\nみり愛にとっては居心地のいい場所、なのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様は自分にとって居心地のいい場所は\nありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おすすめの小説、ぜひ紹介してください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/01/24/6424120/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}